#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/misc/lumakey.rst:11
msgid "Lumakey Effect"
msgstr "Efecto Lumakey"

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/misc/lumakey.rst:15
msgid "In version 15.n of Kdenlive this is in the Misc category of effects."
msgstr "Na versión 15.n de Kdenlive está na sección de efectos «Varios»."

#: ../../effects_and_compositions/video_effects/misc/lumakey.rst:17
msgid "The Lumakey effect changes the clip's alpha channel. To see its effect, you need a transition (like the Composite transition that is available in tracks) and another clip beneath."
msgstr ""
"O efecto Lumakey cambia a canle alfa do fragmento. Para ver o efecto "
"necesitas unha transición (como a «Composta» dispoñíbel nas pistas) e outro "
"fragmento debaixo."
